{"type":"message","id":"6bc56ced","parentId":"f00037eb","timestamp":"2026-02-16T15:50:21.174Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the config-audit.jsonl has recent config changes. The last one was at 2026-02-16T15:43:46.282Z (around 3:43 PM) which updated openclaw.json from 2475 bytes to 2653 bytes. That's interesting.\n\nBut I don't see any gateway logs specifically. The logs directory only has config-audit.jsonl. There might be other log files, or they might be in a different location. Let me check for any other log files or look for error logs.\n\nAlso, I should check the pairing status using the devices\\paired.json and pending.json files.\n\nKey diagnosis from credentials:\n- registered: false - this is the main issue! The WhatsApp account is not properly registered.\n\nNow let me check:\n1. Devices/paired.json - to see if WhatsApp is paired\n2. Look for any error logs or gateway logs\n3. Check if there are any other WhatsApp-related configuration files\n\nLet me read the pairing files and check for other logs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me check the pairing status and look for any error logs:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9a27f20d4b2a41d5b91babcf","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:/Users/mangs/.openclaw/devices/paired.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_99918e7d7f104d8399851044","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:/Users/mangs/.openclaw/devices/pending.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1d3a66fa980645f48911bc25","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"powershell -Command \"Get-ChildItem -Path C:\\Users\\mangs\\.openclaw -Filter *.log -Recurse | Select-Object FullName, Length, LastWriteTime | Format-Table -AutoSize\"","pty":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":24008,"output":613,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24621,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"to