{"type":"message","id":"283f6320","parentId":"3c178c36","timestamp":"2026-02-16T15:55:27.091Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-02-16 21:25 GMT+5:30] Update: Gateway has been restarted. The logs show \"WhatsApp QR received\" at 21:24:28, indicating the plugin is active and attempting to pair.\n\nPlease:\n1. Check if there's a QR code displayed (in web UI or logs) that needs scanning\n2. Verify the WhatsApp account pairing status (is it paired, pending, or failed?)\n3. Check if there are any errors after the QR receipt\n4. Test if messages can be sent/received now\n\nAlso, regarding memory search: We need to configure an embedding provider (OpenAI, Google, or Voyage) with an API key. The user has OpenRouter for LLM but that doesn't provide embeddings. Which embedding provider should we use? If OpenAI, we need the OpenAI API key. Please include this in your report."}],"timestamp":1771257327082,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:coder:main","sourceChannel":"webchat","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"80f9833f","parentId":"283f6320","timestamp":"2026-02-16T15:55:32.533Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is providing an update that the gateway has been restarted and there's a \"WhatsApp QR received\" message in the logs at 21:24:28. This gives me more specific information to work with.\n\nThey want me to:\n1. Check if there's a QR code displayed (in web UI or logs) that needs scanning\n2. Verify the WhatsApp account pairing status (is it paired, pending, or failed?)\n3. Check if there are any errors after the QR receipt\n4. Test if messages can be sent/received now\n\nAlso, they mention memory search needs an embedding provider and ask which one to use - OpenAI, Google, or Voyage. They note that OpenRouter is for LLM, not embeddings.\n\nLet me:\n- Check for more detailed logs since the QR receipt\n- Look for plugin state files\n- Check the web UI status\n- Test message sending\n- Provide recommendations for embedding provider\n\nI need to explore the gateway logs more thoroughly and check for any WhatsApp-specific logs or state.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me check the recent logs for WhatsApp activity and QR code details, and test the WhatsApp channel status."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_80883d2d58514580b0d8d15d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"powershell -Command \"Get-Date -Format 'yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss'\"","pty":true}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c771bf1a20c243bcaccd4ecf","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"powershell -Command \"Get-Content C:\\Users\\mangs\\.openclaw\\logs\\config-audit.jsonl | Select-String -Pattern 'whatsapp|WhatsApp|qr|QR' -CaseSensitive:$false | Select-Object -Last 20\"","pty":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":50082,"output":618,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50700,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},